OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid after death of
OL,4,ALabour group leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to the leader
OL,7,Fof Great Yarmouth's Labour group who
OL,8,Fhas died aged 76.
OL,10,FTrevor Wainwright first became a
OL,11,Fborough councillor in 2002 and later
OL,12,Fled the council from 2012 to 2015.
OL,14,FThe authority, which is flying its flag
OL,15,Fat half mast, said he had recently
OL,16,Fspent time in hospital and had been
OL,17,Faway from the council.
OL,19,FColleagues described him as "a true
OL,20,Fgentleman" while the council said he
OL,21,Fwas "an energetic campaigner who always
OL,22,Fgot things done for his constituents".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
